# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 构建期生成的第三方静态资源
#
# public/excalidraw/** 与 public/vditor/** 由 tools/copy_excalidraw_assets.mjs
# 从 node_modules（npm 包，内容一律 LF）直接字节级复制而来，属于「生成产物」，
# 不应参与任何换行符转换。
#
# 为什么要显式声明：Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 会在 checkout 时把文本写成
# CRLF，而构建脚本随后又从 node_modules 复制回 LF。两者内容逐字节相同，但
# 索引里记录的 stat 尺寸（CRLF）与工作区（LF）不一致，git status 便会长期把
# 上百个文件显示成 "modified"（实际 diff 为空）。声明 -text 后 git 不再做
# 任何 EOL 转换，工作区字节始终等于仓库字节，状态自然稳定。
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
public/excalidraw/** -text
public/vditor/**     -text

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub language statistics
#
# The repository is a Rust desktop shell; the Vue layer is the presentation
# layer. Generated documentation, vendored frontend bundles and binary runtime
# resources would otherwise dominate the language bar, so exclude them here.
# Remove the last line if you want Vue to be counted again.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
public/**                  linguist-vendored
Convertor/**               linguist-vendored
docs/**                    linguist-documentation
src-tauri/assets/vendor/** linguist-vendored
src-tauri/utils/**         linguist-vendored
src/**/*.vue               linguist-detectable=false
